{"id": "mmqa:1bf7604eb61f9ffc258904ccd06d0b7c", "question": "In 2009 Rally Scotland, when Kris Meeke was the rally leader and 2 (20 Nov) was the day, what was the state in special stages?", "evidence_ids": ["mmqa:table:40b7d2d21854b32e6e941db1db98b488", "mmqa:text:728d9ac739b4d2b3d8b8d4f2ae97e712", "mmqa:text:6a2df42a57fb1a4d20048883f6ab4f3c", "mmqa:text:5d5ed7cd69f592b831484f99b5360146", "mmqa:text:d3b58d23d8899740fb78669a9d6b80f5"], "answer_label": "", "result": {"answer": "In special stages during the 2009 Rally Scotland on November 20th, the following occurred: Stage 3 (SS3) was held at Craigvinean 1 (17.34km) with a time of 08:50, won by Kris Meeke with a time of 11:09.4 and an average speed of 93.25km/h. Stage 4 (SS4) was at Blackcraig (11.50km), won by Guy Wilks with a time of 6:47.4 and an average speed of 101.62km/h. Stage 5 (SS5) was at Errochy (21.56km), won by Kris Meeke with a time of 13:09.4 and an average speed of 98.32km/h. Stage 6 (SS6) was at Drummond Hill (18.66km), won by Guy Wilks with a time of 11:41.2 and an average speed of 95.80km/h. Stage 7 (SS7) was at Craigvinean 2 (17.34km), won by Kris Meeke with a time of 11:21.0 and an average speed of 91.67km/h.", "answer_items": ["Stage 3 (SS3) was Craigvinean 1 (17.34km), with a time of 08:50, won by Kris Meeke with a time of 11:09.4 and an average speed of 93.25km/h.", "Stage 4 (SS4) was Blackcraig (11.50km), won by Guy Wilks with a time of 6:47.4 and an average speed of 101.62km/h.", "Stage 5 (SS5) was Errochy (21.56km), won by Kris Meeke with a time of 13:09.4 and an average speed of 98.32km/h.", "Stage 6 (SS6) was Drummond Hill (18.66km), won by Guy Wilks with a time of 11:41.2 and an average speed of 95.80km/h.", "Stage 7 (SS7) was Craigvinean 2 (17.34km), won by Kris Meeke with a time of 11:21.0 and an average speed of 91.67km/h."], "citations": ["mmqa:table:40b7d2d21854b32e6e941db1db98b488"], "abstained": false, "answer_label": "", "provider": "local", "model": "google/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-q4_